{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10284110","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10284110","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1028411001:1":{"text":"你们是……等等，我好像见过你们！你们是从薄暮丛林来的，对吧？","source_cn":"你们是……等等，我好像见过你们！你们是从薄暮丛林来的，对吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA3B107F520FEB44","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1028411002:1":{"text":"我叫西奥多，是采集队的队长。","source_cn":"我叫西奥多，是采集队的队长。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x13C0C49B68229464","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1028411003:1":{"text":"你们这么久没有音讯，塔兰村里的人很着急，是遇到什么问题了吗？","source_cn":"你们这么久没有音讯，塔兰村里的人很着急，是遇到什么问题了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F6AD020A4B9A1B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028411004:1":{"text":"遇到什么问题？我们遇到的全都是问题！","source_cn":"遇到什么问题？我们遇到的全都是问题！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A1450E9C90A4006","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028411005:2":{"text":"先是在这里遇到<style=\"highlight\">两个古板的植物学家</style>，死活不让我们采集木材。","source_cn":"先是在这里遇到<style=highlight>两个古...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6CF582F2677275E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_fem